Order matching engine. Type 'help' for commands.
> help
Commands:
  buy <trader> <qty> <price>   submit a buy order
  sell <trader> <qty> <price>  submit a sell order
  cancel <orderId>             cancel a resting order
  book [levels]                show the book (default 10 levels per side)
  trades                       show the most recent trades
  help                         show this message
  quit                         exit
> buy alice 5 100
Order 1 accepted
Order 1 rested: Buy 5 @ 100
> quit
